34	// to a group repository and, if so, returns its member repositories.
35	//
36	// Returns nil, nil when the manager answered and the repository is not a group,
37	// and an error when it could not be asked. Those two are not the same thing:
38	// the caller caches the first and must not cache the second, or one unreachable
